      Wspieram agencje i firmy w kodowaniu front-end oraz wdrażaniu projektów do WordPress. Tworzę semantyczny kod
      zoptymalizowany pod SEO i WCAG. Terminowo, bez niespodzianek.</p>

    <div class="relative c-welcome__skills max-w-2xl ~mb-10/14 order-3 font-normal ~text-2xs/xs uppercase opacity-60"
         style="visibility: hidden">

      <div class="arrow-skills absolute -translate-x-[80%] opacity-50 rotate-[41deg] scale-[0.6] bottom-[50%] max-lg:hidden"
           style="visibility: hidden">
        <img src="<%= require("./img/assets/arrow-03.svg") %>" alt=""/>
        <p
           class="absolute top-0 tracking-wider left-0 font-light text-3xl text-white normal-case -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-[150%]">
          skills</p>
      </div>

      <span>ACF</span>
      <span>Adobe XD</span>
      <span>Figma</span>
      <span>Git</span>
      <span>Interactive GSAP animations</span>
      <span>JavaScript</span>
      <span>Pixel Perfect</span>
      <span>RWD</span>
      <span>Semantic code</span>
      <span>SEO</span>
      <span>Tailwind CSS</span>
      <span>Vite</span>
      <span>Vue.JS</span>
      <span>WCAG</span>
      <span>Webpack</span>
      <span>Web Development</span>
      <span>Wordpress</span>
    </div>

    <nav class="absolute top-12 ~right-6/12 items-center nav flex opacity-0">
      <button type="button"
              class="hidden mr-6 text-sm tracking-wider uppercase duration-150 opacity-30 hover:opacity-70 sm:block"
              data-target="#portfolio">portfolio</button>
      <!-- <button type="button"
              class="hidden mr-6 text-sm tracking-wider uppercase duration-150 opacity-30 hover:opacity-70 sm:block"
              data-target="#faq">faq</button> -->
      <button type="button"
              class="hidden mr-6 text-sm tracking-wider uppercase duration-150 opacity-30 hover:opacity-70 sm:block"
